para.p:
Out of positional encoding variants for attention models, xPos (which was designed for length extrapolation) is slightly better than the others;
also note that all attention models were only tested up to sequence length 214=16384superscript214163842^{14}=16384 due to memory limitations.
Out of other SSMs, H3 and Hyena are similar, contrary to the findings in [84].

We overview several prior works related to our methods.
We mention that some of the most closely related models include recurrent layers such as S4, S5, and quasi-RNNs;
as well as end-to-end architectures such as H3, RetNet, and RWKV.
